  "name": "Google Forms",
  "label": "Google Forms API v1 — forms, responses, Pub/Sub watches",
  "description": "Official Google Forms API v1 at https://forms.googleapis.com. Handler: OfficialApiNode. Auth: OAuth access token as Bearer (customer supplies a current token). Watches publish to the customer's Cloud Pub/Sub topic (forms.watches.create) — not Drive files.watch. Watches last seven days. trigger.listen is ingress (BPMN message event); a Pub/Sub subscription must forward into message-event ingress. Customer owns the Google account / Workspace. Responses are respondent PII. Never log tokens.",
  "icon": "assignment",
  "tags": [
    "forms"
  ],
  "category": "CRM & Marketing",
  "author": "5c8b0d45-1d10-4f2e-844c-2318af96b2fa",
